{#
  ===========================================================================
  REVIEW PAGE. NOT A SHIPPING PAGE. NOT LINKED FROM ANY NAV.

  Concept B1: two columns plus a persistent preview pane showing one featured dish per section.

  noindex in front matter, and /internal/* already carries an X-Robots-Tag in
  public/_headers, which a template refactor cannot lose. There is no sitemap
  in this build; eleventyExcludeFromCollections keeps this page out of one if
  somebody adds it.

  RENDERED FROM DATA. Rows come from menu.json through the `dishesFor` filter
  scoped to east-village, the same filter the location pages use. The mockups
  in _reference/menu-concepts/ are a design reference only: not one dish name,
  description or price was transcribed out of their HTML.

  See components/menu-concept.njk for the shared body and _data/menuConcepts
  for the copy, the sourcing and the open decisions.
  ===========================================================================
#}
{%- set spriteIcons = ["ramen-bowl", "chopsticks-noodles"] %}
{% include "components/icon-sprite.njk" %}

{#
  PRICES OFF. The client asked for prices off /menu/ and did not rule on a
  location menu, so off is the default and the decision is Steve's. menu.json
